## How to think about this task

NOVA.md is read by the agent at the start of every session. Write it **for the agent,
not for humans**. Every sentence should answer: "what does the agent need to know
to avoid mistakes and work efficiently?"

| Good (useful) | Bad (not useful) |
|---|---|
| `Run uv run pytest -x to test` | `The project uses pytest for testing` |
| `NEVER edit files in migrations/` | `The codebase follows clean architecture` |

